"name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T20:03:06-08:00","id":66216,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I appreciate that the guy's busy but Fallen World seems farther along, I guess, but likely only cause we don't know anything about Idigam Chronicles. He's said he will start blogging, so we'll see.<br /> <br /> Here's what we know:<br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">* Harmony's changing. Doesn't it seem weird that low-Harmony makes you &quot;too spirit&quot; when high-Harmony makes you balanced? Where's the end for &quot;too human&quot;?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">* Tribes are the &quot;What?&quot;, Auspices are the &quot;How?&quot;, and the Idigam are the Outside Context Problem.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#3E3E3E\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\">* Gifts and renown are a sore spot that will see significant attention.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 02-05-2014, 11:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T23:10:00-08:00","id":66279,"title":"","content":"Trust me, Idigam is farther along than Fallen World.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","co